Hawkeye is a privileged FreeBSD diagnostic and operations doctor (MASH).
It consults local knowledge (FTS SQLite from hawkeye-data), optionally a
local llama.cpp model or a remote LLM, and applies operator-confirmed
plans. Apply defaults to dry-run. It is not a public chat UI.

This port ships the binary. The hawkeye-data knowledge kit is a runtime
dependency, so pkg install hawkeye installs both.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/hawkeye
